  "solution": {
    "text": "PV = Constant<br />On differentiating both sides, we get<br />PdV + VdP = 0<br />PdV = -VdP<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mtext>1</mtext> <mtext>P</mtext> </mfrac> <mtext> </mtext><mtext>=</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mo>−</mo><mfrac> <mtext>1</mtext> <mtext>V</mtext> </mfrac> <mtext> </mtext><mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>dV</mtext></mrow> <mrow> <mtext>dP</mtext></mrow> </mfrac> <mtext> </mtext><mtext>=</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext>β</mtext></mrow> </math><br />Since <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">β</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> ; inverse relation result into rectangular hyperbola.",
